<section class="page-shell">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">FAQ</div>
        <h1>Answers to common questions.</h1>
        <p>Everything you need to know about choosing, personalising, and ordering handmade pieces.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-faq faq-list">
      <h2>Orders &amp; customisation</h2>
      <details>
        <summary>How do I place an order?</summary>
        <p>Browse the <a href="/shop">shop</a>, choose a piece, and send us an enquiry on WhatsApp. You can also <a href="/gift-box">build a gift box</a> or <a href="/custom-order">request a custom order</a>. We’ll confirm availability and next steps with you.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How long do custom orders take?</summary>
        <p>Most custom crochet orders take 3–7 working days, depending on the design, materials, and finishing details. We’ll confirm an estimate after reviewing your brief.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I request specific colours or sizes?</summary>
        <p>Often, yes. Share your preferred colours and dimensions in a <a href="/custom-order">custom order request</a>, and we’ll confirm what is possible for your design.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Do you offer gift packaging and handwritten notes?</summary>
        <p>Gift box styling and a personalised message are available. Add your preferences in the <a href="/gift-box">gift box builder</a> and we’ll confirm the final details with you.</p>
      </details>

      <h2>Delivery &amp; product care</h2>
      <details id="delivery">
        <summary>Do you deliver?</summary>
        <p><%= settings && settings.delivery_info ? settings.delivery_info : 'We arrange delivery across Nairobi and beyond. Delivery options, costs, and timing are confirmed with you after your order enquiry.' %></p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How should I care for my crochet piece?</summary>
        <p>Care varies by item. See the care instructions on its <a href="/shop">product page</a>, or <a href="/contact">contact us</a> if you need help caring for a specific piece.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>When do I pay?</summary>
        <p>Orders are enquiries rather than instant checkout. We’ll confirm the final price, availability, delivery, and payment details with you before proceeding.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="story-cta">
      <div><h2>Still have a question?</h2><p>We’re happy to help you choose the right handmade piece.</p></div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
